##UNREACHABLE

Check:

ssh automation@server

Check inventory:

ansible-inventory -i inventory/dev.ini --graph

Run verbose mode:

ansible all -i inventory/dev.ini -m ping -vvv

##Sudo Failure

Confirm:

sudo -l

Use:

become: true

Ensure the account has appropriate sudo permissions.

##YAML Syntax Failure

Check:

ansible-playbook --syntax-check playbook.yml

Then:

ansible-lint playbook.yml

if Ansible Lint is available.
